#. engine/messages/coverage.py (ticket 19b): a view no step will read and nothing excludes, named as m0-screens 6.11's "Unaccounted" list names it ("S-20 8th floor beam layout"). In M0 a view is not assigned to steps: 6.9, "a view nobody proposed a step for is excluded with a reason ("other: …") until M1".
msgid "engine.coverage.unaccounted"
msgstr "{named, select, number {{sheet} {view}} title {{view}, on “{sheet}”,} other {{view}, on a sheet with no number or title,}} is unaccounted: no step will read it and it is not excluded, so Step 1 for its Discipline cannot be confirmed. Exclude it with a reason; if a step should read it, choose Other and say which (views are assigned to steps from M1)."

msgid "engine.coverage.unaccounted_untitled"
msgstr "{kind, select, plan {A plan} section {A section} elevation {An elevation} schedule {A schedule} detail {A detail} notes {A notes view} legend {A legend} title_block {A title block} key_plan {A key plan} perspective {A 3D view} other {A view}} with no title, {named, select, number {on {sheet}} title {on “{sheet}”} other {on a sheet with no number or title}}, is unaccounted: no step will read it and it is not excluded, so Step 1 for its Discipline cannot be confirmed. Exclude it with a reason; if a step should read it, choose Other and say which (views are assigned to steps from M1)."
